  "notes": "{土砂崩|どしゃくず}れ is a common natural disaster in mountainous Japan.\n\nFORMS:\n- {土砂|どしゃ} (earth and sand, sediment) + {崩|くず}れ (collapse)\n\nRELATED DISASTERS:\n- {地|じ}すべり: landslip\n- {崖崩|がけくず}れ: cliff collapse\n- {土石流|どせきりゅう}: debris flow, mudslide\n- {山崩|やまくず}れ: mountain collapse\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {避難|ひなん}: evacuation\n- {警戒|けいかい}: warning, alert\n- {災害|さいがい}: disaster\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {土砂崩|どしゃくず}れ{警戒|けいかい}{区域|くいき}: landslide warning area\n- {土砂崩|どしゃくず}れに{注意|ちゅうい}: beware of landslides",
